<section class="page-intro"><a class="breadcrumb" href="<%- url_for('/') %>">首页 / 关于我</a><span class="eyebrow">THE PERSON BEHIND THE BURGER</span><h1 class="page-title">你好，这里是双层鳕鱼堡。</h1><p>保持饥饿，也保持对问题的好奇。</p></section><section class="about-layout glass-card"><div class="about-portrait"><img src="<%- url_for('/assets/burger.jpg') %>" alt="双层鳕鱼堡头像" width="360" height="360"><span>DOUBLE FISH. DOUBLE CURIOSITY.</span></div><div class="about-copy"><span class="mini-label">ABOUT ME</span><h2>把好奇心，叠进每一天。</h2><p>我用「双层鳕鱼堡」这个名字，记录解题、写代码和探索开源世界的过程。</p><p>这里有逆向工程里一层层拆开的逻辑，有 Pwn 里反复推敲的边界，也有密码学、Web 安全和数字取证带来的新发现。遇到值得保留的思路，就写成 Markdown；碰到好用的项目，就放进星标。</p><p>这间小店的菜单会慢慢增加。希望你翻到某一页时，也能发现一点有意思的东西。</p><a class="button button-primary" href="<%= config.github %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%- icon('github') %> 在 GitHub 找到我 <%- icon('diagonal') %></a></div></section><section class="about-directions"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">A FEW OF MY FAVORITE FLAVORS</span><h2 class="section-title">我的探索方向<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h2></div></div><div class="direction-grid"><% blog().directions.forEach(direction => { %><a class="glass-card about-direction" href="<%- url_for(`/categories/${direction.name}/`) %>"><%- icon(direction.icon) %><h3><%= direction.label %><span><%= direction.name %></span></h3><p><%= direction.note %></p><small><%= direction.count %> 篇题解 <%- icon('arrow') %></small></a><% }) %></div></section>
